atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.mp4?t=1754931152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your waifu loadout</strong> from a growing pool of unlocked NPCs, each offering unique tactical bonuses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before a match, select your squad. During the match, choose which perks to activate between rounds\u2014adjusting your strategy based on the flow of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Begin with a small selection, then unlock new perks mid-match as the situation evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    No fixed builds\u2014every round presents fresh upgrade decisions that shape your path to victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/bf0a3d32b7da2eb3904c960eb6bab261.avif?t=1754931152\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.poster.avif?t=1754931152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.webm?t=1754931152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.mp4?t=1754931152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock &amp; hire rare and bodacious Waifu Mercenaries to assist you in battle and build out your Mother Base.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Merc Waifus to your squad and get perk bonuses in matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign MWs to combat and research facilities to grow your base power and unlock better Waifus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build additional facilities and customize your Mother Base to keep your mercenary army satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with, or invade, other player\u2019s Mother Bases to achieve world domination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/a9e849a53c6865c2f71f13d9cbc968cf.avif?t=1754931152\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96e55980f55777a1803b09a38fc71497.poster.avif?t=1754931152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96e55980f55777a1803b09a38fc71497.webm?t=1754931152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96e55980f55777a1803b09a38fc71497.mp4?t=1754931152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime is hardcoded into WTF\u2019s DNA, as you orchestrate the rise of the world's largest Waifu PMC in a visual novel style dating sim.</p>",
